# Caddy binary pin — P30 / D-P30-5.
#
# WHAT THIS PINS
# Every Nerdit release tarball bundles ONE Caddy static binary, at the exact
# version and with the exact bytes recorded here. The daemon's ProxyManager
# spawns it (see [proxy].caddy_binary); bundling means one artifact, one
# checksum, one tested combination — Caddy is never downloaded at install time
# and never resolved from the customer's PATH unless they configure it.
#
# The hashes below are sha256 of the UPSTREAM release assets from
# https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy/releases/download/v<VERSION>/, i.e.:
#   caddy_<VERSION>_linux_amd64.tar.gz  -> CADDY_SHA256_LINUX_X86_64
#   caddy_<VERSION>_linux_arm64.tar.gz  -> CADDY_SHA256_LINUX_ARM64
#   caddy_<VERSION>_mac_arm64.tar.gz    -> CADDY_SHA256_MACOS_ARM64
# .github/workflows/release.yml downloads the asset for its matrix cell and
# verifies it against the matching line here BEFORE extracting; a mismatch
# fails the build. Upstream publishes sha512 in caddy_<VERSION>_checksums.txt —
# these sha256 values were cross-checked against that file at pin time.
#
# HOW TO BUMP
#   1. Pick the new upstream release:
#        curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/caddyserver/caddy/releases/latest \
#          | grep '"tag_name"'
#   2. Download the three assets and recompute ALL THREE hashes (they change
#      together — never bump the version without re-hashing every line):
#        V=<x.y.z>
#        for a in linux_amd64 linux_arm64 mac_arm64; do
#          curl -fsSLO "https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy/releases/download/v$V/caddy_${V}_${a}.tar.gz"
#        done
#        sha256sum caddy_${V}_*.tar.gz     # macOS: shasum -a 256
#   3. Cross-check against upstream caddy_${V}_checksums.txt (sha512), edit the
#      four lines below, and re-run the WP-1 smoke (packaging/smoke.sh) — the
#      bundled proxy is a tested combination, not a floating dependency.
#
# Format: strict KEY=VALUE, one per line, no quotes, no spaces. Parsed with
# grep/cut by release.yml (never `source`d) and by any local build.

CADDY_VERSION=2.11.4
CADDY_SHA256_LINUX_X86_64=527fbf917c39189a1e3b31d34fa955601680b2d5c8055d2a87b8b9588dec7bb9
CADDY_SHA256_LINUX_ARM64=52d42ae12b3462097e9868da6dfed3c9648ae12edd3b3638102312af84cb6904
CADDY_SHA256_MACOS_ARM64=9efb0af2d6cf09cfb5053c0e51721b9b3d4956d346234f39368d943d25a3c9a7
